Package: gmoq
Title: Distributional GWAS by the Genomic Method of Quantiles
Version: 0.8.1
Description: Stage 2 of the Genomic Method of Quantiles (G-MoQ). Maps the
    per-quantile SNP effects from an unconditional (RIF) quantile GWAS onto the
    parameters of a distributional model (means, variances, mixture components)
    by least squares, with standard errors propagated from the Stage 1
    cross-quantile covariance.
